  "kind": "engine.scenario",
  "name": "delivery-flush-interval-bounds",
  "description": "collector.flushIntervalMs is a period: 0 is rejected (it would re-arm the periodic flush at the same instant forever) and 1 is the smallest. A periodic flush fired late re-arms at the first tick after the fire, computed in one step, skipping the ticks the host missed.",
